<view class="city-page ab-safe-bottom"><view class="city-header"><view><text class="city-header__eyebrow">AB CLUB · DIRECTORY</text><text class="city-header__title">全球城市目录</text><text class="city-header__subtitle">GLOBAL → REGION → COUNTRY / AREA → CITY → AB CLUB NODE → EVENT</text></view><ab-evidence-label mode="{{runtimeMode}}" /></view><ab-city-hero city-name="{{hero.label}}" city-name-en="{{hero.nameEn}}" timezone="{{hero.timezone}}" catalog-label="{{hero.catalogLabel}}" operational-label="{{hero.operationalLabel}}" operation-evidence="{{hero.operationEvidence}}" image-src="{{hero.imageSrc}}" image-alt="{{hero.imageAlt}}" photo-credit="{{hero.photoCredit}}" media-rights-label="{{hero.mediaRightsLabel}}" /><view class="node-fact" aria-role="note"><text class="node-fact__label">所选城市的 AB Club 节点</text><text class="node-fact__value">{{nodeLabel}}</text><text>运营状态：{{nodeOperationalLabel}} · 主理人：{{nodeOrganizerLabel}}</text><text class="node-fact__warning">城市入口 ACTIVE 不等于节点 LIVE，也不等于该城市已有真实活动。</text></view><view class="directory" aria-role="region" aria-label="7 国 13 城完整层级"><view class="directory__global">全球 / Global</view><view wx:for="{{regions}}" wx:key="id" class="region"><view class="region__heading"><text>{{item.label}}</text><text>{{item.nameEn}}</text></view><view wx:for="{{item.countries}}" wx:for-item="country" wx:key="id" class="country"><view class="country__heading"><text>{{country.label}}</text><text>{{country.nameEn}}</text></view><button wx:for="{{country.cities}}" wx:for-item="city" wx:key="id" class="city-row {{city.id === selectedCityId ? 'city-row--selected' : ''}}" data-city-id="{{city.id}}" bindtap="onSelectCity" hover-class="city-row--pressed" aria-label="{{city.label}}，目录 ACTIVE，运营 {{city.operationalLabel}}，时区 {{city.timezone}}" ><view><text class="city-row__name">{{city.label}} / {{city.nameEn}}</text><text class="city-row__id">{{city.id}} · {{city.timezone}}</text></view><view class="city-row__states"><text>目录 ACTIVE</text><text>运营 {{city.operationalLabel}}</text></view></button></view></view></view><button class="city-page__back" bindtap="backToEvents" hover-class="city-row--pressed">返回活动首页</button></view>